From ee6e83b773939aba03e381116f58eab4c31f53b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mstsc-wine <mstsc-wine@localhost>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:07:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] devobj: Add stub dll forwarding to setupapi.

Windows 8+ setupapi is built on devobj.dll; Remote Desktop's mstscax.dll
imports 13 DevObj* functions statically and fails to load without it.

Exports whose stdcall argument counts match a public SetupDi*W function are
forwarded to it.  DevObjCreateDeviceInfoList and DevObjGetClassDevs differ
in shape; their mapping is derived from call sites in mstscax.dll.
